!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/link/invalid/a-family-member-applied-at-a-use-site-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/link-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.10 (inline types, proposed for Revision 40)"
  description: """
    `dog_of<text>` composes onto `pet`, so closing it at a use site would put a record with no name into `pet`'s
    family: a member a tag could not name and a binding could not map. An undeclared expansion whose chain would
    name a declared type is refused (§5.2); a family member is declared, `dogs => dog_of<text>`.
    """
  error: { category: resolver }
}
